From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 23:11:53 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DT: add the vdin1 post blend input on sm1 and later SoCs

The LED feed needs the screen as shown, and these SoCs list no vdin1
input that gives it. VD1 has no GUI, OSD1 has no video, and VPP is the
encoded tunnel under TV-led DV. G12A and G12B get post blend from the
driver default. The list holds seven inputs and OSD3 has no user.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s4_common.dtsi  | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s5_common.dtsi  | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s6_common.dtsi  | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s7_common.dtsi  | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s7d_common.dtsi | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_sc2_common.dtsi | 6 ++++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_sm1_common.dtsi | 3 +++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_t7_common.dtsi  | 6 ++++++
 8 files changed, 45 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s4_common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s4_common.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s4_common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/amlogic/coreelec_s4_common.dtsi
@@ -0,3 +0,9 @@
 	/delete-property/ tocodec_inout;
 	/delete-property/ tdmout_index;
 };
+
+&vdin1 {
+	/* VD1, VD2, VD3, OSD1, OSD2, VPP, POST_BLEND; the driver holds 7 */
+	fe_ports = <0x0000a002 0x0000a003 0x0000a004 0x0000a005
+		    0x0000a006 0x0000a008 0x0000a009>;
+};
